		     standalone library at github.com/spiculedata/ossie
		     (saiku#1396 L2/L3). MondrianToOssieConverter stays in this
		     module because it depends on Mondrian; the pure-Jackson
		     parser layer is external so any JVM tool — Superset,
		     Metabase, Trino wrappers — can pull it without dragging
		     in Mondrian or Spring.

		     SNAPSHOTs resolve from GitHub Packages (see the
		     github-ossie repo definition in the root pom); release
		     versions will land on Maven Central. -->
		<dependency>
			<groupId>bi.saiku.ossie</groupId>
			<artifactId>ossie-core</artifactId>
			<version>${ossie.version}</version>
		</dependency>

